  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;Without evidence to the contrary, the true impact of the proposed extension on local trees is undetermined. This has potential to cause harm to the mature street tree as well as other trees in close proximity to the application site and, should there be eventual damage to the trees and root protection areas, this could have further impacts in terms of loss of local habitat and biodiversity. This is contrary to the aims and objectives of Policies 79 and 80 of the adopted Waltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024), which seek to retain trees and resist biodiversity and habitat losses.&lt;/p&gt;"
